  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "tiphera-archtypes-and-harmonization",
      "title": {
        "en": "Tiphera, Archtypes and Harmonization"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30084_cre1",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "TIPHERA IS THE GAMBLING CHARACTER\nTiphera centers around her (Generally) randomly generated Archtype cards:\nCircle ◯, Triangle △ and Square ◻\n◯\nHeal 60%\n1 AP\n△\nShield 60%\n30% Multiplitive to next Attack card FIRST HIT ONLY\n◻\nHeal 60%\nDraw 1 Archtype\nGenerally what you create is random, and they can clog the draw pile\nONLY USE QUANTUM SEED WHEN YOU CAN USE FORM RIGHT AFTER\nYOU DO NOT WANT ARCHETYPES TO CLOG YOUR DECK"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30084_uni1",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_30084_uni3",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Form1, Duel 5, Archetype distinct effects and Event Horizon Form Upgrade"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Each Archetype comes with 2 distinct effects\n◯\nHeal 60%\n1 AP\nForm 1 just doubles one of the lines effect: example\n◯ ◯\nHeal 120% or Heal 60%\n1 AP 2 AP\nDuel 5 instead just generates A NEW Archetype, just with one effect removed e.g.\n◯ ◯\n1 AP or Heal 60%\nEvent Horizon \"Form Upgrade\" every Archetype used, upgrade a random effect, e.g.\nEvent Horizon (Form 0/3) Event Horizon (Form 1/3) Event Horizon Form 3/3)\n1 AP 2 AP 1 AP\n1 Draw 1 Draw 4 Draw\n40% Buff 40% Buff 40% Buff\nThe line that gets upgraded is random, type of Archetype doesn't effect it"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "E2 Archetype"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30084_bhc",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "E2 the first 3 Archetypes used each turn create a special one\nThe Build your own Archtype has effects based on what you used\n◯ 160% Healing Worst effect\n△ 30% Buff Best effect\n◻ Draw 1 Archetype Situational effect\nExample:\n△△△\n90% Buff\n◯△◻\n160% Healing\n30% Buff\nDraw 1 Archetype\nUsually want to aim for △, ◻ if you need, and not ◯"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
