      "title": {
        "en": "Part 12"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Gearbag: 0 AP Draw 2\nAttack: If you for some reason to need have continuous cards to draw compared to Gearbag\nDivine Attack!: Repeatable source of AP each turn if you need it\nReorganize: 1 AP for 3 Cards compared to 0/2 for Gearbag\nGlorious: +1 AP but rng if it works"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Event Horizon: This is great, but is RNG if its cycle positive or generates AP\nFirst Aid: 2 Perma Moral but needs to be Heavened\nStrategic: If you need Ego Points for some reason\nWanderer: Tech that justbeats some bosses"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30084_bhc",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany I"
