              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany II"
              },
              "rating": "6/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Seed 1:Makes 3 Random Archetypes for 0\nSeed 2: SELECT WHAT ARCHETYPE TO MAKE, Only one that can get Draw Divine\nSeed 3: Main appeal is it's always draw neutral, random upside to make 2 extra Archetypes\nSeed 4: Great with Form 3\nSeed 5: Creates 1 Archetype in hand and 1 in deck, the rate is terrible"
          }
        },
