        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "CnD 1: Feels good in Chaos, but outside of it no\nCnD 2: Main DPS Tiphera\nCnD 3: This is terrible\nCnD 4: This kills 1 draw, but it does give you free damage in future turns, always a possile include if you want it\nCnD 5: Nuke"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
