                "en": "Epiphany II"
              },
              "rating": "4/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Form 1: Being able to double up to 3 effects is very good\nForm 2: Draw 4 Archetypes, Exhaust one Exhaust card in hand\nForm 3: Just keep this one in hand ideally, but you could always use it too\nForm 4: Select and Exhaust 3 Exhaust cards of allies, draw 1 for each exhausted\nForm 5: Gambling isn't good"
          }
        },
