        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Duel 1: When 2 Arche created, create 1 identical card in discard\nDuel 2: Placing the Archetype directly into your hand is very big\nDuel 3: When Arch type [] is activated, create 1 different archetype in discard\nDuel 4: 2 of the Archetype you want, 4 in total, feels really good in Chaos, but is a skill, skill darn good\nDuel 5: Duplicating the effect of a Form 1 is very good, but this is ALOT of rng, also +5 Exhaust cards"
